## 🔍 Key Insights

- Turnover is concentrated in specific high-overtime roles, suggesting workload is a leading driver alongside salary.
- Salary and better compensation elsewhere together account for the largest share of resignation reasons.
- Departments with the highest burnout index also show the highest resignation counts, reinforcing burnout as an early warning signal ahead of exits.

## 🛠️ Tech Stack

- **Visualization:** Power BI (Cards, Donut charts, Gauge, Table, Area chart, Column charts, Slicer)

